[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0010","text":"──是吗\n昨晚那么热闹啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0020","text":"是的……\n一场非常……激烈的……战斗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0030","text":"为了各自的……生存……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0040","text":"决出唯一……胜者的……混战……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0050","text":"实乃……\n一场……好胜负……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0060","text":"哈哈，你玩得很尽兴嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0070","text":"各位……\n各有各的……战斗方式……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0080","text":"那种东西会体现出个性吧\n看到你玩得开心，我也很高兴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0090","text":"呵呵……\n是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021200_01_0100","text":"快乐的回忆……\n又……增加了……"}]
